From: Armbian Build Framework <build@armbian.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rt: expose the RT suffix to Armbian version detection

Armbian's kernel version helper reads localversion-next before packaging.
Kbuild reads either localversion filename, so use the name understood by both
and keep the resulting -rt28 kernel release unchanged.

---
 localversion-rt => localversion-next | 0
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename localversion-rt => localversion-next (100%)

diff --git a/localversion-rt b/localversion-next
similarity index 100%
rename from localversion-rt
rename to localversion-next
-- 
2.34.1
